<title>POLAND: RAFAKO SWINGS TO PLN 1.7 MLN LOSS IN SEPT.</title>
<headline>RAFAKO SWINGS TO PLN 1.7 MLN LOSS IN SEPT.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net loss		 1.73 vs   1.76 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   1.73 vs   2.68 profit</p>
<p> Operating loss	 3.40 vs   3.49 profit</p>
<p> Sales		   33.85 vs  36.90</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     8.90 vs  14.32</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 8.90 vs  23.39</p>
<p> Operating profit    20.71 vs  28.52</p>
<p> Sales		  289.29 vs 269.92</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish industrial boilermaker is</p>
<p>Raciborskie Farbryki Kotlow Rafako SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
